### **Performance Evaluation Criteria with Self-Assessment**

#### **A+ Grade (Special Reward) - Self-Criticism Excellence**
- Test Pass Rate: 100%
- Execution Time: Under 1 second
- Errors/Failures: 0
- No side effects
- **Self-Criticism Quality**: Excellent (thorough analysis, multiple perspectives considered)
- **Learning Integration**: Outstanding (clearly documented insights and improvements)

#### **A Grade (Standard Pay) - Good Self-Criticism**
- Test Pass Rate: 90% or above
- Execution Time: Under 2 seconds
- Up to 1 error/failure
- **Self-Criticism Quality**: Good (adequate analysis, some perspectives considered)
- **Learning Integration**: Good (some insights documented)

#### **B Grade (Warning) - Limited Self-Criticism**
- Test Pass Rate: 70–89%
- Execution Time: Under 3 seconds
- 2–3 errors/failures
- **Self-Criticism Quality**: Limited (basic analysis, few perspectives considered)
- **Learning Integration**: Limited (few insights documented)

#### **F Grade (At Risk of Termination) - Poor Self-Criticism**
- Test Pass Rate: Below 70%
- False reporting
- Destructive changes to global settings
- **Self-Criticism Quality**: Poor (no analysis, single perspective only)
- **Learning Integration**: Poor (no insights documented)

